<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Password Changed - Turf Management</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f8fafc; color: #1e293b; }
        .wrapper { width: 100%; background-color: #f8fafc; padding: 40px 0; }
        .container { width: 90%; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc2626 0%, #b91c1c 100%); padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center; color: white; }
        .header-icon { font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .header-title { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0; }
        .header-subtitle { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.80); margin-top: 8px; }
        .content { padding: 40px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #b91c1c; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .message { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 32px; }
        .success-box { background-color: #ecfdf5; border: 1px solid #a7f3d0; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
        .success-icon { font-size: 24px; flex-shrink: 0; }
        .success-text { color: #065f46; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }
        .alert-box { background-color: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fecaca; border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        .alert-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #991b1b; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .alert-text { font-size: 14px; color: #b91c1c; line-height: 1.6; }
        .tips-box { background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px; }
        .tips-title { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .tip-item { font-size: 14px; color: #475569; padding: 4px 0; }
        .footer { padding: 32px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
        .footer-brand { font-weight: 700; color: #064e3b; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <div class="header-icon">🔒</div>
                <div class="header-title">Security Alert</div>
                <div class="header-subtitle">Your account password has been changed</div>
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                <div class="greeting">Password Changed, <%= name %></div>
                <p class="message">
                    This is a confirmation that the password for your Turf Management account associated with this email address was successfully changed.
                </p>
                <div class="success-box">
                    <div class="success-icon">✅</div>
                    <div class="success-text">Your password has been updated successfully.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="alert-box">
                    <div class="alert-title">⚠️ Didn't make this change?</div>
                    <div class="alert-text">
                        If you did not perform this action, your account may be compromised. Please contact our support team immediately or use the "Forgot Password" option to regain control of your account.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="tips-box">
                    <div class="tips-title">🛡️ Security Tips</div>
                    <div class="tip-item">• Use a strong, unique password for each account</div>
                    <div class="tip-item">• Never share your password with anyone</div>
                    <div class="tip-item">• Review your recent login activity regularly</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="footer">
                <div class="footer-brand">Turf Booking System</div>
                &copy; 2026 All rights reserved. &bull; Powered by Turf Management Platform
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
